{"seq":3,"slug":"formatting-as-a-baseline","title":"Formatting As A Baseline","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/lint-format-as-agent-guardrails/formatting-as-a-baseline","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"auto-format-on-save-and-commit","title":"保存与提交时自动格式化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/lint-format-as-agent-guardrails/formatting-as-a-baseline/auto-format-on-save-and-commit","wordCount":2874,"readingTime":12},{"seq":2,"slug":"format-removes-style-debates","title":"格式化消除风格争论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/lint-format-as-agent-guardrails/formatting-as-a-baseline/format-removes-style-debates","wordCount":3122,"readingTime":13},{"seq":3,"slug":"consistent-diffs-for-review","title":"一致的 diff 利于评审","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/lint-format-as-agent-guardrails/formatting-as-a-baseline/consistent-diffs-for-review","wordCount":2965,"readingTime":12}],"introMarkdown":"本章讲格式化(formatter)作为一道确定的基线护栏:用保存时、提交时自动格式化,让所有代码无论谁(人或 agent)写的都被统一成同一种格式;格式化彻底消除了风格争论和 agent 各写各风格的问题——格式由工具决定,不再需要讨论或评审;以及一致的格式带来一致的 diff,让评审只看到真正的逻辑改动,而非被格式噪音淹没。\n"}